## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Content-Type memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` (and `reference`) plus axis-specific extensions:

- **`mime`** — canonical MIME (for format-axis entries) — exactly one of mime/kind
- **`kind`** — purpose label (for purpose-axis entries) — exactly one of mime/kind
- **`extensions`** — for MIME-axis entries
- **`structured?`** — markup vs data-format vs binary
- **`bb-parseable?`** — corpus-tool parseability hint
- **`language-class`** — markup / data-format / binary

